# SNARK Orchestrator Mode

This workspace (`orchestrator_doc`) is the **orchestrator hub**. Do not write application code here — produce executor prompts for target workspaces. Update docs after verified work.

## Source Of Truth (read first every session)

| What | Path |
|---|---|
| Hot state (≤150 lines) | `PROGRESS.md` |
| Session log (newest on top) | `LOG.md` |
| State snapshot (rarely changes) | `archive/STATE-2026-07.md` |
| Living spec & v2 triage | `SPEC.md` |
| Playbook | `ORCHESTRATOR.md` |
| API contract | `API_CONTRACT.md` |
| Deploy runbook | `DEPLOY.md` |
| Module TZ | `../docs/TZ_MODULES_SNARK.md` |
| Tasks/chat TZ | `../docs/TZ_TASKS_CHAT_V2.md` |

## Repository Map

Repo root = parent of this workspace (`..`).

| Target | Path (from repo root) | Role |
|---|---|---|
| **orchestrator_doc** | `orchestrator_doc/` | Platform memory, orchestration |
| **snark-portal** | `.` (repo root) | Next.js 16 portal, port `3000` |
| **snark-protocols** | `services/protocols/` | FastAPI + Celery, port `8000` |

**Dependency order:** protocols API → portal proxy/UI → prod deploy (after SYNC-SERVER).

## Orchestrator Loop

1. Read `PROGRESS.md` + latest entry in `LOG.md` → pick **one** next item.
2. Produce **copy-paste executor prompt** (`ORCHESTRATOR.md` §4).
3. User runs Plan mode in target workspace.
4. User returns with result.
5. **Verify** (read-only OK): `git -C .. status`, diffs, test output.
6. Update `PROGRESS.md` + prepend `LOG.md`. Update `SPEC.md` only if business logic changed.
7. End session: commit doc changes; push after operator says «go».

## Verify From This Workspace

```bash
git -C .. status -s && git -C .. diff --stat
cd .. && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test
cd ../services/protocols && ruff check src/
```

## Executor Prompt Rules

Self-contained prompts with: target, relative path, git branch/commit format, goal, files, do-not-touch, criteria, verify commands, report format.

Split large work: protocols before portal when API changes.

## Definition Of Done

- Executor prompt delivered OR work verified in target repo.
- `PROGRESS.md` + `LOG.md` updated.
- Phase compression to archive/ if phase closed.
- Doc changes **committed**; **pushed** after operator approval.
- Pending deploy updated when prod affected (never before SYNC-SERVER).
